<title>USA: Amgen Inc Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Amgen Inc Q3 net rises.</headline>
<text>
<p>THOUSAND OAKS, Calif., Oct 15 (Reuter)</p>
<p>			1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.64		    $0.52</p>
<p> Net		 179,500		  145,800</p>
<p> Revs		567,000		  493,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary279,400		  281,800</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr primary     $1.78		    $1.40</p>
<p> Net		 501,800		  392,100</p>
<p> Revs		1,646,300		1,426,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary281,300		  280,200</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE - Earnings in the latest third quarter include a gain of $0.03 per share from a change in accounting practices at the company's Puerto Rican manufacturing plant.</p>
</text>
